{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2022-05-20 07:27:00', 'title': 'GOOGLE CONCEDES KEY ISSUES ON GOOGLE PLAY POLICIES; MATCH GROUP WITHDRAWS TEMPORARY RESTRAINING ORDER IN RESPONSE TO CONCESSIONS.', 'text': 'TEMPORARY AGREEMENT PREVENTS GOOGLE FROM FORCING MANDATORY USE OF GOOGLE PLAY BILLING; REMOVING MATCH GROUP APPS THAT OFFER ALTERNATE BILLING SYSTEMS FROM GOOGLE PLAY STORE; GAINING UNFETTERED ACCESS TO CONSUMER DATA AND BEHAVIOR. DALLAS , MAY 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MATCH GROUP (NASDAQ: MTCH) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS WITHDRAWN ITS REQUEST FOR A TEMPORARY RESTRAINING ORDER AGAINST GOOGLE, AFTER GOOGLE MADE VARIOUS CONCESSIONS THAT MATCH GROUP DEMANDED TO BENEFIT CONSUMERS.'}